				{
					"category": "mitigation",
					"details": "This model has reached its end of life inn 2009. Please apply \r\nthe mitigations below. Contact your local technical support for \r\nmore information. \r\nCustomers are advised that the webserver is disabled by default. Because web services are \r\nonly necessary for specific maintenance, configuration, or monitoring activities, it is advised to \r\ndisable web services all together during times when the services are not needed. Customers \r\nare also advised to:\r\n• Configure access control lists to restrict web server access to authorized IP addresses.\r\n• Protect access to Modicon products with network, industrial, and application firewalls.",
